PROJECT ShopAPI

TARGET PHP

PROFILE ECOMMERCE

USE payment.razorpay
USE notification.email

DATABASE MYSQL

AUTH JWT

MODEL User
    name STRING
    email STRING UNIQUE
    password STRING

MODEL Product
    name STRING
    sku STRING UNIQUE
    price INTEGER
    active BOOLEAN OPTIONAL

MODEL Order
    status STRING
    total INTEGER

RELATION User HAS_MANY Order
RELATION Product HAS_MANY Order

VALIDATE email REQUIRED EMAIL
VALIDATE password REQUIRED MIN 8
VALIDATE sku REQUIRED MAX 64
VALIDATE price MIN 0
VALIDATE total MIN 0

ROUTE POST /login
ROUTE GET /products
ROUTE GET /products/{id}
ROUTE POST /products
ROUTE PATCH /products/{id}
ROUTE GET /orders PROTECTED
ROUTE GET /orders/{id} PROTECTED
ROUTE POST /orders
ROUTE GET /users/{id}/orders PROTECTED
